KYA KAR SAKTE HO
----------------
  * handle jodo  -- @handle, kai saare comma se, ya poora x.com link
  * kitna peeche tak scrape ho  -- aaj / 3 / 7 / 15 / 30 din
  * har kitni der me chale      -- 5 min se roz tak
  * ek handle ki kitni page padhe -- 2 se 15
  * "Abhi scrape karo" / "Roko"
  * har handle ko alag se roko ya list se hatao

DATA KAHAN JAATA HAI
--------------------
  pulse_master.master_tweets -- wahi collection jisme pipeline ka data
  jaata hai, aur wahi merge rules:

      _id            = Tweet ID (URL se) -> duplicate ban hi nahi sakte
      numbers        -> $max   (ginti kabhi ghatti nahi)
      text           -> $set   sirf jab naya value khaali na ho
      Source Folders -> "Admin Tracker" jud jaata hai

  Matlab yahan se aaya data agle dashboard push me dono dashboard
  (All-India + UP) aur Handle Analytics me waise hi dikhne lagta hai
  jaise network folder se aaya data.

  DHYAN: jo handle aapki mapping (handle_master.json) me nahi hai,
  uske tweets to aa jaayenge par State / Party / Designation khaali
  rahenge -- wo "needs mapping" me dikhega, jaisa kisi bhi naye handle
  ke saath waise bhi hota hai.

HAAL AUR LOG
------------
  Tab par hi dikhta hai:
    * abhi chal raha hai ya nahi, kis handle par, kitne me se kitne
    * pichhli baar: kitne NAYE, kitne UPDATE, kitne handle, kitne error
    * agla scrape kitni der me
    * neeche poora log (har handle ki line, error laal me)
  Har 5 second me apne aap refresh.

COOKIE
------
  Wahi x_config.json use hoti hai jo pehle se hai (auth_token, ct0,
  twid). Alag se kuch nahi bharna. Cookie na ho ya expire ho jaaye to
  tab laal me saaf bata deta hai.

X PAR BOJH NA PADE
------------------
  * ek waqt me ek hi scrape (do kabhi saath nahi chalte)
  * har call ke beech viraam
  * 429 (rate-limit) ya 401 (cookie expire) par turant ruk jaata hai
    aur log me wajah likh deta hai -- agli baar se phir chalu

SERVER CHALU HOTE HI
--------------------
  Scraper 15 second baad background me apne aap chaalu, har 30 minute
